+// DCS VR Control (0006): late submissions.
+//
+// Live DCS flights on Pimax OpenXR in 3X (90 Hz) logged "a:~90 fps" from the
+// runtime with "Missed:30, Discard:30" every second. The first synthetic after
+// each real frame reached the runtime 4.8-8.5 ms (p50) and 9.9-17.4 ms (p90)
+// after the runtime's xrWaitFrame for its slot had returned, against 1.1 ms or
+// less on a healthy slot: it needs the application's next real frame, and
+// with the GPU over budget that frame came late. The runtime then shows the
+// previous image again for that slot and throws one of the next two away, so
+// the headset sees about 60 distinct frames a second, unevenly - while every
+// count the layer kept (by display time) read a clean 90.
